      <div class="dir-top"><code>${esc(d.dir)}</code><span class="muted">${pct(d.share)} · κ${n0(d.kappa)}</span></div>
      <div class="dir-bar"><i style="width:${Math.min(100, (d.share || 0) * 100)}%"></i></div></div>`).join('')}</div></div>`);

